From: Elden SM8750 CPHY bring-up <elden-sm8750-cphy@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dsi: SM8750 CPHY DSI link clocks for Elden

Selective Elden adaptation of the fixed pin
6f97250ead155fc3b980856323e99a4623dae73d https://github.com/h0cheung/tb322fc-linux-kernel/commit/6f97250ead155fc3b980856323e99a4623dae73d
reworked for the SM8750 CPHY DSI link-clock programming path.

---
